# Providence "second condolence" (delight-eggs batch, feat/delight-eggs) — a rare, delayed follow-up
# to providence-commiseration.ftl's death lines, only ever offered to a player who already received
# one this round (see ProvidenceSecondCondolenceSystem). Distinct wording from the first condolence:
# this reads as Providence circling back later, not repeating itself.

solreign-providence-second-condolence-1 = Solreign wishes to follow up on your earlier passing: has anything improved? (This is a rhetorical question. Nothing requires a response.)
solreign-providence-second-condolence-2 = A brief supplementary notice: your file from earlier today has been reviewed a second time. It remains unchanged. As, presumably, do you.
solreign-providence-second-condolence-3 = Solreign would like it noted that it has, in fact, been thinking about you since your incident. This is not a threat. Probably.
solreign-providence-second-condolence-4 = Correction to an earlier condolence: the moment of silence was rounded down. Please accept this belated additional half-second.
